{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 在人物动机和跨段因果衔接上明显不如 Y，尤其 S05—S07、S11—S13，Y 更容易让人明白情绪转变的原因。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"边听边扫，X 的短句、关键词加亮和感受分时出现，能让观众迅速抓住每段核心，也能跟上音乐中的细微变化，不必在短时间内读完长段解释。Y 的优势是心理因果和故事连续性更清楚，但部分短时段的长句阅读负担较大。综合实际观看体验，我更愿意选 X：它更像伴随音乐展开的屏幕提示，Y 则更像一份完整的心理叙述。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e8d1c0e6-7115-432b-8ad5-41722ff165df", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T220719220132Z", "elapsed_seconds": 65.172, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:08:24.405122+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c0557d695a0c2fd7f5adf7c80f180eae205ae13f6ca0ef596396d0564a28134b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eed